WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.970
Part fifteen: cancel a stand or game. For weather, or IU and Levy changes. Cancel stands or a whole game, and let people know.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.637
Cancel is in Hub tools, on the admin home.

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:16.360
Tap Cancel a stand or game.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.200
Pick the game. SignUp.com games and Hub games are both here.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.283
Check the stands to cancel. Check them all to cancel the whole game.

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:26.615
Pick a reason.

00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:29.589
Add a note if you want. It goes in the email.

00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:33.510
Leave Email the people signed up checked to tell them.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.080
Canceling emails people, so it takes a second tap.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:51.230
Done. Their shifts are canceled and logged as Excused, so it never counts against them, and they were emailed. If the stand opens after all, Reinstate the checked stands puts everyone back.
